  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Educational field guide",
    "overview": "The interface borrows the clarity of an educational field guide: paper surfaces, deep green actions, a restrained vermilion accent, a readable serif for learning content, and practical sans-serif controls. Keep the supplied TaleSpark owl as the brand asset. Useful content and diagrams lead; omit stock photography, decoration-only illustration, moving tickers, and gradient ornament.",
